{"articleNo":"580450","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=580450&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 부산대학교 제1회 장애학생·청년 미래준비 국제심포지엄 안내","writer":"학생과","writeDate":"2026.10.26","hit":"17","attachments":[{"name":"부산대학교 제1회 장애학생·청년 미래준비 국제심포지엄 포스터.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=580450&attachNo=169058"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">부산대학교 장애학생지원센터에서 장애학생 및 청년의 진로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">직업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">사회참여를 주제로 안내와 같이 국제 심포지엄을 개최하오니</span></div><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">관심있는 학생들은 아래 내용을 참고하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"></p><p class=\"0\"><br></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">행사명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">회 장애학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">청년 미래준비 국제 심포지엄</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">주제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">학교 이후의 삶을 준비하다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">진로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">자립 그리고 사회참여</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">일시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: 2026. 10. 31.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">토</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">) 13:00~19:30</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">부산대학교 대학본부 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">층 대회의실 및 세미나실</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">○ </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">참석 규모</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">: 250~300</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움,